# YouTube Data API v3 key, used only for the "Sugeridos" panel (search for videos related
# to the track currently active in the library). Everything else in the app — playback,
# oEmbed metadata autofill, the embeddability check — works with no key at all.
#
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com: enable "YouTube Data API v3", then
# APIs & Services > Credentials > Create Credentials > API key. Restrict it (Application
# restrictions > HTTP referrers, API restrictions > YouTube Data API v3 only) since it ships
# inside the client bundle. Free tier: 10,000 units/day, ~100 searches/day (100 units each).
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in your real key for local dev; set the
# same variable in Vercel > Project Settings > Environment Variables for production.
VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
